<p>This policy explains which personal data we collect when you use this shop, why, and what rights you have.</p>
<h2 id="controller">1. Who is responsible</h2>
<p>The data controller is <strong>Fashion Web Store ApS</strong>, Example Street 1, 9000 Aalborg, Denmark. You can reach us at <a href="mailto:privacy@example.com">privacy@example.com</a>.</p>
<h2 id="data-we-collect">2. Data we collect</h2>
